---
description: Require changelog updates for production code edits only
alwaysApply: true
---

# Changelog (mandatory)

Before finishing a task that changed **production code** (not tests), update the
nearest `CHANGELOG.md` (walk up from edited paths). In monorepos use the
package-level file when present.

Under `## [Unreleased]`, add bullets in `### Added`, `### Changed`, or `###
Fixed`. Summarize what changed for users, not file lists.

**Do not** update the changelog when: read-only work; **Plan mode** or plan-only
tasks (including `.cursor/plans/`); **tests-only** edits (`tests/`, `*_test.py`,
spec/fixture files); or the user asked not to.

When creating a new project, add `AGENTS.md` with a Changelog section and seed
`CHANGELOG.md` if missing.
